	(text "Analog front end.\nAzimuth ends are AZ_POT_3 and AZ_POT_7 from the rotor sheet. \nThe wiper is ROTOR_RETURN.\n330 ohm from +3V3, then 1k, BAT54 clamps, then 10k and 100 nF (about 159 Hz).\n\nElevation is the same circuit. \nJ20 is TBD (Mouser, through-hole).\nD260 and D261 are SMAJ90CA, LCSC C5353147. \n\nAzimuth clamps D6 and D7 stay on the rotor sheet.\nTR1 and its conditioning stay on rotor_drive. I_SENSE is only carried across to I_ADC.\nVIN_WARN is 39k over 1k into the comparator, with no capacitor."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 203.2 30.48 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "5035aef6-a19b-4762-99b5-fc01074d74ed")
	)
